				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/><persName ref="p8455">Vogleri</persName><note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><persName ref="p8455">Hans Vogler d.J.</persName> (vgl. auch unten <ref target="file11529">Nr. 1486</ref>, 1-8. 14f u. ö.).</note> ingenium quale esset, satis ostenderat <persName ref="p8171">Theodoro</persName> nostro <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName>,<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName>' Brief an <persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName> ist nicht erhalten.</note> itaque <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ex illo poteras scire omnia; ad hęc <persName ref="p8071">pater</persName><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4"><persName ref="p8071">Hans Vogler d.Ä.</persName></note> ipse iampridem advertit, quale sit, ut me post <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>illum tibi de hoc dicere sit supervacuum.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Tamen, quia iterum postulas, dicam, quod sentio: <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Est ob flexibilitatem nimiam nimium incertum; ut enim omnia potest percipere momento <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>propemodum, ita potest nusquam consistere, sed quicquid tulit praesens animi impetus, hoc <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>sequitur.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Itaque custode eget certo, perpetuo et firmo, eget etiam non[?] omnigenarum <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>et novarum artium exercitatione, sed certarum et graviorum, quarum congres<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>su discet animi incertitudinem propemodum instar harundinis mobilem.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Etiam<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>Kann auch als</hi> Nam <hi>gelesen werden.</hi></note> hoc in eo malum est, quod non credit nec advertit monentem.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Porro <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>qua maxime in re sit exercendus postea, meum iudicium patri dixi.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Non ob<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>iicerem artem novam; erit ea nova materia patrem fallendi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Sed in iis studiis, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>in quibus coepit bene, cogerem progredi, nec diversum hic argumentum, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>sed unum idemque praescriberem tantisper, dum in eo se intelligeret profecisse, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>et simul de moribus, de constantia, de fide, de veritate certa praecepta quotti<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>die in certis et illustribus exemplis meditanda proponerem et illorum <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>contrarium aeque illustribus exemplis declararem.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Hęc disciplina si illum revocare <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>non potest et continere, ad stivam alligarem toto biennio.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Hęc de illo <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>paucis.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Utinam tantum mihi vel pater vel is, qui eum ad me adduxit, <persName ref="p7073">Hospinianus</persName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><persName ref="p7073">Leonhard Hospinian</persName>, zu dieser Zeit Schulmeister in <placeName ref="l411">Reichenweier</placeName> (vgl. <persName ref="p164">Amerbach</persName>, Korr. V 225-227. 235).</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>dixisset de eius ingenio, quantum ego nunc tibi; potuissem cura<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>re iuvenem melius, quanquam me absente<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><persName ref="p1365">Grynäus</persName> war Ende Oktober 1540 zum Religionsgespräch nach <placeName ref="l569">Worms</placeName> gereist und Ende Januar 1541 zurückgekehrt; vgl. <bibl source="b12">HBBW X</bibl> <ref target="file11470">[Nr. 1427]</ref>, S. 176, Anm. 1, bzw. oben <ref target="file11499">Nr. 1456</ref>.</note> fere plurimum deliquit.<pb type="edition" next="118"/></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Video <lb xml:id="p1z22"/><persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName> nihil ex me beneficii admittere; quid beneficii dicam?</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Etiam non <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>leve indicium benevolentis erga se animi fert itaque omni<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>Vor</hi> omni <hi>gestrichenes</hi> nih.</note> me offi<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>cio humanitatis excludit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Nova, quae <placeName ref="l410">Ratispona</placeName> ad nos <persName ref="p467">Bucerus</persName> scribit, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>habes hic per <persName ref="p8418">Myconium</persName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Vgl. unten <ref target="file11528">Nr. 1485</ref>, 1 mit Anm. 1.</note>.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Hęc allata sunt hodie.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Itaque videre <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>licet, hii homines quantam reipublicę curam gerant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale in domino.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/><persName ref="p1753">Leonem</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p1753">Leo Jud</persName>.</note> orabis, ut ad <persName ref="p4285">Bessererum</persName><note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><persName ref="p4285">Bernhard Besserer</persName>, vgl. die in der folgenden Anm. genannten Briefe.</note> <placeName ref="l513">Ulmensem</placeName> <persName>Hartman</persName>[?], qui graviter <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>decumbit, scribat diligenter et virum optimum literis consoletur; <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>hoc <persName ref="p1055">Frechtus</persName> orat<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Ein entsprechender Brief <persName ref="p1055">Frechts</persName> liegt nicht vor; seine Bitte erreichte <persName ref="p1365">Grynäus</persName> durch Vermittlung <persName ref="p315">Jakob Bedrots</persName> (s. dessen Brief an <persName ref="p1365">Grynäus</persName> vom 21. März in Zürich StA, E II 350, 425f; vgl. auch <persName ref="p315">Bedrots</persName> Brief an <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> vom 20. April, unten <ref target="file11545">Nr. 1502</ref>).</note>.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale iterum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Ultima marcii.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/><persName ref="p1365">S. Grynęus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Domino <persName ref="p495">Heinricho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, fratri <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>colendissimo suo.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tyguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
